<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Occidental.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Occidental.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Canadian Occidental lost 1/8 to 25 in morning trading on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
